#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Start or inspect the configured companions using the maintained launchers.

Examples:
  dev/companions start --settings config/companions.example.toml --dry-run
  dev/companions models --settings config/companions.toml
  dev/companions start --settings config/companions.toml
  dev/companions restart-chat --settings config/companions.toml --actor mira

Settings are JSON or TOML. The default brain is local LM Studio; changing to
Claude/Gemini requires an explicit Responses gateway, model route and key-env
name. No provider fallback, downloads, native rebuild or automatic restart.
restart-chat changes only the owned conversation listener, keeping the native
body/session and journals. Cross-host migration/logout is an operator step.
"""

